  "name": "Error Notifier (global)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Global error notifier\n\nFires whenever ANY workflow that names this one as its Error Workflow fails.\n\nSet it per workflow: open the workflow -> three dots -> Settings -> **Error Workflow** -> `Error Notifier (global)`. Worth setting on every workflow, not just subscription-lifecycle.\n\nWhy this exists: notifications sit at the END of a chain, so a failure halfway through used to produce NO message at all -- the run just stopped and nothing said so.",
